# Day 6: WebRTC Core Implementation

This commit marks Day 6 of development.

## Day 6 Files (WebRTC Implementation):
- app/static/js/webrtc.js - WebRTC Manager class
- app/static/js/room.js - Room Controller
- app/templates/room.html - Video Room UI
- app/static/css/room.css - Room Styling

## Day 5 Files (Signaling Server):
- app/socket/events.py - Socket.IO event handlers
- app/controllers/room_controller.py - Room business logic
- app/routes/room_routes.py - Room API endpoints

Note: Due to the development flow, Day 5 and Day 6 files were committed together
in commit 96f2ff2, but are logically separate features:
- Day 5: Backend signaling infrastructure
- Day 6: Frontend WebRTC implementation

